  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">BOL 2001 Budget support - BOP support Bol 2001</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">BOL 2001 Budgetst&#xf6;d</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Budgetst&#xf6;d till Bolivia under 2001. Det svenska st&#xf6;det avser att finansiera genomf&#xf6;randet av Bolivias fattigdomsstrategi, PRSP. Huvudm&#xe5;ls&#xe4;ttningar inom strategin &#xe4;r att &#xf6;ka inkomst och  arbetsm&#xf6;jligheter, kapacitetsuppbyggnad, sociala skyddssystem f&#xf6;r de fattiga, social integrering och deltagande.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Swedish budget support to Bolivia during 2001 aims at supporting the Bolivian Poverty Reduction Strategy (PRSP) in its aims to increase employment and income opportunities, increase capacity building, increase security and protection for the poor and promote integration and social participation.</narrative>
  </description>
